@startuml CloudWarehouse_Enterprise_Context_Map
title Enterprise Context Map — Factory Digital Ops Landscape

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  BorderColor #2C3E50
  RoundCorner 8
}

rectangle "CloudWarehouse\nBilling & Pricing BC\n.NET Modular Monolith\n— DELIVERED (this internship)" as CW #D5F5E3
rectangle "PDA No-Order Reporting\nShop-floor Execution BC\nAndroid + Spring Boot\n— DELIVERED (this internship)" as PDA #FCF3CF

rectangle "Siemens Mendix\nOps / Citizen App BC\n(factory landscape)" as MX #EAF2F8
rectangle "Ops Safety Dashboard\nVisualization BC\n(factory landscape)" as DS #F5E6E8

CW -[#27AE60,thickness=2]-> CW : internal modules\nMasterData / Import\nPricing / Billing / Helper

PDA -[#27AE60,thickness=2]-> PDA : own stack\nApp / API / PDA_NoOrder DB

PDA ..[#7F8C8D,dashed].> CW : <<Planned>>\ncross-system join
MX ..[#95A5A6,dashed].> CW : <<Planned>>
DS ..[#95A5A6,dashed].> CW : <<Planned>>
PDA ..[#95A5A6,dashed].> DS : <<Planned>>
MX ..[#95A5A6,dashed].> DS : <<Planned>>

legend left
  |= Style |= Meaning |
  | Green solid boxes + solid loops | Systems delivered now |
  | Dashed grey arrows | Future integration only |
  | Light boxes | Factory landscape (not this internship) |
endlegend

@enduml
